WEBVTT

00:13.630 --> 00:16.570
♪Tear up all the memories of the past♪

00:17.760 --> 00:20.410
♪Let go of all regrets♪

00:20.410 --> 00:25.820
♪I exchange my whole life for a change♪

00:27.290 --> 00:30.840
♪If I decide to let my guard down♪

00:31.390 --> 00:35.680
♪Will I fall for the wrong one♪

00:36.640 --> 00:40.190
♪I dare to give
without fear of destruction♪

00:41.180 --> 00:43.390
♪Love refuses to fall asleep♪

00:43.390 --> 00:46.430
♪I dare to shake heaven and earth♪

00:46.430 --> 00:48.510
♪Even with different paths and goals♪

00:48.510 --> 00:52.570
♪I have no regrets♪

00:53.080 --> 00:57.850
♪Because you're
an unsolvable riddle by fate♪

00:57.850 --> 01:02.140
♪I pray for a miracle♪

01:02.140 --> 01:03.550
♪Over the time♪

01:03.550 --> 01:05.560
♪Even if I'm burned out♪

01:05.560 --> 01:08.410
♪I'm willing to search for the miracle♪

01:08.410 --> 01:11.680
♪Of being with you forever♪

01:11.680 --> 01:16.380
♪I will travel with you all the way♪

01:17.080 --> 01:24.730
♪Love is the most beautiful in life♪

01:37.400 --> 01:42.759
=Sword and Fairy=

01:43.320 --> 01:46.600
=Episode 34=

02:00.420 --> 02:01.020
Master,

02:04.860 --> 02:05.340
Shifang,

02:07.180 --> 02:08.259
and all common people

02:09.820 --> 02:11.180
who are suffering.

02:17.140 --> 02:19.500
(The hole of spring Pureness
can foresee the future.)

02:21.860 --> 02:23.160
(Whoever holds the Pureness key ring)

02:23.740 --> 02:25.140
(may catch a glimpse of the future.)

02:27.020 --> 02:28.220
(If I could foresee)

02:28.740 --> 02:29.940
(the true weakness of Kun...)

02:41.500 --> 02:42.780
Why can't I see anything?

02:45.860 --> 02:46.340
Master.

02:49.180 --> 02:50.380
Because I am not determined enough?

02:53.500 --> 02:54.140
Master.

02:55.460 --> 02:55.980
Help me.

02:58.620 --> 02:59.540
I have to see it.

03:01.140 --> 03:01.580
(Xiu,)

03:02.940 --> 03:04.020
(to foresee the future,)

03:05.180 --> 03:06.060
(don’t use your eyes,)

03:07.020 --> 03:08.340
(but feel it with your heart.)

03:17.900 --> 03:18.540
(Master.)

03:19.740 --> 03:20.500
(Your eyes...)

03:22.060 --> 03:23.020
(I see.)

03:24.540 --> 03:26.260
(In order to protect
the power of spiritual vein,)

03:27.460 --> 03:29.060
(Shennong sealed the Nine Springs.)

03:30.020 --> 03:31.700
(The leakage of divine power
is an accident.)

03:32.900 --> 03:34.380
(Otherwise, even as a guardian,)

03:35.820 --> 03:37.380
(if he wants to use
the power of Pureness,)

03:38.579 --> 03:39.660
(he has to pay the price.)

03:41.620 --> 03:44.900
Xiu, what's the reason
the Pureness exists?

03:46.740 --> 03:47.500
Master.

03:50.820 --> 03:52.380
It's a mockery from the heaven,

03:54.060 --> 03:54.980
making people think

03:55.420 --> 03:56.780
they can know the secrets of heaven.

03:58.740 --> 03:59.780
But they find themselves

04:00.780 --> 04:01.980
cannot escape from fate.

04:05.860 --> 04:06.980
If I say so,

04:07.940 --> 04:08.980
would you be disappointed?

04:10.780 --> 04:12.340
Pureness and people.

04:13.420 --> 04:15.580
I protect them

04:15.660 --> 04:16.579
because I want to.

04:17.700 --> 04:19.260
Xiu, you are no longer a little girl.

04:19.980 --> 04:20.980
Don't be swayed by others

04:21.459 --> 04:22.860
in your way moving forward.

04:23.980 --> 04:25.500
Just ask yourself,

04:26.220 --> 04:27.580
and be true to your heart.

04:32.420 --> 04:33.740
That's really tough.

04:40.420 --> 04:40.860
Master.

04:42.060 --> 04:42.900
You once said,

04:43.540 --> 04:45.340
you're glad to have the opportunity

04:46.420 --> 04:48.540
to be a guardian of Pureness,

04:49.900 --> 04:52.220
who can guide the future
in the direction you want

04:53.420 --> 04:54.659
and protect the people you want to.

04:56.780 --> 04:57.300
Today,

04:59.700 --> 05:00.180
I get it now.

05:03.700 --> 05:06.300
Xiu, you have found your path.

06:19.140 --> 06:19.980
Way of Heaven.

06:21.340 --> 06:21.940
Fate.

06:24.140 --> 06:24.700
That power

06:24.700 --> 06:26.620
that thinks it can control everything.

06:28.180 --> 06:29.660
At the cost of these eyes,

06:31.460 --> 06:33.340
show me what I want to see.

06:34.860 --> 06:35.620
If they're not enough,

06:37.380 --> 06:38.300
take my hands,

06:39.740 --> 06:40.460
my legs,

06:41.680 --> 06:42.820
and my life.

07:37.740 --> 07:38.460
Mr. Zuo.

07:39.220 --> 07:39.820
Just surrender.

07:40.860 --> 07:42.580
The Zhengwu Alliance has been wiped out.

08:01.620 --> 08:02.540
Zhengwu Alliance

08:03.180 --> 08:05.420
fights for the common people.

08:05.740 --> 08:06.820
Dying in battle today

08:08.140 --> 08:09.740
is also a way to fulfill my mission.

08:12.460 --> 08:14.100
You are an opponent I respect.

08:15.540 --> 08:17.700
Bros, don't go far.

08:18.060 --> 08:19.340
I'm coming.

08:53.620 --> 08:54.060
General,

08:54.460 --> 08:56.060
Her Lordship and Lord Shuo Xuan
are coming soon.

10:48.580 --> 10:49.540
Today, I

10:51.100 --> 10:51.700
bestow this sword

10:52.700 --> 10:53.340
upon you.

10:55.580 --> 10:57.100
I have lived for decades,

10:57.860 --> 10:59.260
and have never misjudged any person.

11:02.900 --> 11:03.700
From now on,

11:04.180 --> 11:06.660
I will mobilize all our disciples

11:07.180 --> 11:08.260
against Zhu Yu.

11:12.580 --> 11:13.300
Rest assured,

11:14.980 --> 11:15.580
we'll

11:17.460 --> 11:18.220
handle the rest of it.

11:43.180 --> 11:44.140
Her Lordship.

12:03.540 --> 12:04.260
Bad news.

12:04.900 --> 12:05.580
Bad news.

12:07.020 --> 12:07.660
What's wrong?

12:07.780 --> 12:08.660
Luohuan, Qi,

12:08.700 --> 12:09.420
and Luo Zhaoyan

12:09.420 --> 12:10.480
have gone to Zangfeng Plains.

12:15.740 --> 12:16.700
I was careless.

12:17.580 --> 12:18.140
I know

12:18.620 --> 12:19.900
they would never let a companion

12:19.900 --> 12:20.860
go on an adventure alone.

12:21.900 --> 12:24.020
Bring back to Yue Jinzhao
and Qi immediately.

12:24.420 --> 12:25.780
We can't lose them.

12:27.260 --> 12:28.540
I'll go get them both.

12:28.740 --> 12:29.260
I'll go too.

12:30.380 --> 12:31.340
You two, be careful.

12:33.420 --> 12:33.820
Don't worry.

12:51.380 --> 12:51.860
Your Lordship.

12:53.100 --> 12:54.580
Rehai has already moved here.

12:55.980 --> 12:56.700
Shuo Xuan.

12:57.260 --> 12:58.260
Open the Rehai.

13:07.220 --> 13:07.780
Yue Qi.

13:08.100 --> 13:09.300
You are the young lord of Yu clan.

13:10.100 --> 13:10.700
Zhu Yu.

13:11.140 --> 13:11.900
Stop.

13:12.340 --> 13:14.060
I will find the perfect solution.

13:20.300 --> 13:20.940
Zhu Yu.

13:21.420 --> 13:21.780
Qi.

13:23.100 --> 13:23.580
Shuo Xuan.

13:24.700 --> 13:25.140
Hurry.

13:29.740 --> 13:30.300
Zhaoyan.

13:30.820 --> 13:31.540
Open the Rehai.

13:47.580 --> 13:49.740
Yue Qi and Zhu Yu
share the same bloodline.

13:51.100 --> 13:53.380
Her blood is the key
to release the Bloodbinding.

13:54.300 --> 13:57.260
You need to get Shuo Xuan to be tainted
with the blood and damage her seriously,

13:57.580 --> 14:00.100
forcing her to go to Mist Soul
of Core of the Demon Realm to heal.

14:01.940 --> 14:04.060
The blood of Yue Qi,
combined with the power of Rehai,

14:05.100 --> 14:06.660
can activate the way to

14:07.000 --> 14:08.820
release the Bloodbinding
between Zhu Yu and Mist Soul.

14:10.540 --> 14:13.140
Once the Bloodbinding is released,
Zhu Yu'll lose her Vitality Energy soon.

14:14.220 --> 14:17.900
That will be the perfect time
to kill Zhu Yu.

14:19.580 --> 14:20.340
Mist Soul.

14:21.260 --> 14:22.020
Your Lordship.

14:23.820 --> 14:24.380
Your Lordship.

14:25.820 --> 14:26.700
Your Lordship.

14:26.940 --> 14:27.940
What's wrong, Your Lordship?

14:28.900 --> 14:29.500
Mist Soul

14:31.140 --> 14:32.820
is releasing the Bloodbinding.

14:37.020 --> 14:37.780
Your Lordship.

14:51.780 --> 14:52.420
Yue Qi.

14:52.820 --> 14:53.940
It's you who did this.

14:54.660 --> 14:55.100
Shuo Xuan.

14:55.820 --> 14:56.700
Go protect Her Lordship.

14:57.620 --> 14:58.420
Leave it to me.

15:17.060 --> 15:18.020
You go after Zhu Yu.

15:18.100 --> 15:18.820
Leave it to us.

15:20.300 --> 15:20.660
Let's go.

15:26.620 --> 15:27.420
General Lin Yuan.

15:27.860 --> 15:28.660
Long time no see.

15:29.340 --> 15:29.820
Ms. Ge.

15:30.700 --> 15:32.500
We've been dealing with
each other for years,

15:32.980 --> 15:34.420
but we have to end up at this point.

15:35.780 --> 15:37.220
Qingfei, just beat them.

15:37.860 --> 15:38.180
Go.

15:38.300 --> 15:38.980
Catch them!

15:52.260 --> 15:52.740
Ying Xuwei.

15:54.860 --> 15:55.900
I saw the weakness

15:56.900 --> 15:57.940
of Zhu Yu at Pureness.

15:58.420 --> 15:59.020
First one

15:59.600 --> 16:01.040
is at three feet along the lateral line.

16:27.060 --> 16:27.700
Second one

16:28.400 --> 16:29.620
is in the center of the dorsal fin.

16:43.420 --> 16:44.100
Third one

16:44.980 --> 16:46.300
is at two feet on the pectoral fin.

18:23.820 --> 18:24.780
(My daughter.)

18:26.020 --> 18:27.100
(It is your blood)

18:27.820 --> 18:30.220
(that makes it difficult for me
to bloodbind the Mist Soul again.)

18:58.500 --> 18:59.460
Her Lordship.

19:20.900 --> 19:22.500
(Why do I have the sudden palpitations?)

19:29.020 --> 19:29.300
Report.

19:29.900 --> 19:30.900
Ms. Ge is injured.

19:38.740 --> 19:40.620
Keep an eye on the Kun.

19:40.660 --> 19:41.100
Yes.

20:18.660 --> 20:20.500
Since when have you been so selfless?

20:22.020 --> 20:23.420
Having spent many years with you,

20:24.060 --> 20:25.220
I am naturally influenced.

20:31.220 --> 20:31.820
Pretty good.

20:34.380 --> 20:35.700
If Hanjiang were here,

20:37.860 --> 20:39.300
he'll be very pleased.

20:43.420 --> 20:43.900
Of course.

21:14.860 --> 21:15.420
Uncle.

21:16.140 --> 21:17.180
You gave me your demonic power.

21:18.740 --> 21:19.460
It's the punishment.

21:20.420 --> 21:22.220
To be tainted
by the demonic power you despise,

21:23.180 --> 21:23.620
are you mad?

21:27.260 --> 21:27.740
Uncle,

21:29.460 --> 21:29.940
thank you.

21:39.540 --> 21:40.020
Qingfei.

21:41.420 --> 21:41.820
Qingfei.

21:45.140 --> 21:46.260
Why is she so seriously injured?

21:46.700 --> 21:48.460
Kun's scales fell down,

21:48.940 --> 21:49.940
and we held them up,

21:49.940 --> 21:51.260
letting others go first.

21:52.140 --> 21:52.700
And then,

21:53.100 --> 21:55.260
Qingfei pushed me and Lin Yuan away,

21:56.260 --> 21:58.340
but she got trapped underneath.

21:59.700 --> 22:02.140
I managed to dig them up.

22:02.900 --> 22:04.260
Lin Yuan is already dead.

22:05.260 --> 22:07.220
And Qingfei is also seriously injured.

22:09.300 --> 22:10.300
Xiaoyuan.

22:13.020 --> 22:13.580
I'm here.

22:13.860 --> 22:15.060
I am okay.

22:16.860 --> 22:17.740
Now

22:19.140 --> 22:19.700
hurry up...

22:20.340 --> 22:21.220
Go...

22:21.620 --> 22:22.460
Go...

22:22.860 --> 22:23.620
monitor

22:25.100 --> 22:27.620
the situation of Sea of Clear Skies.

22:28.420 --> 22:29.220
But...

22:31.420 --> 22:32.100
You go.

23:02.660 --> 23:03.220
Young lord.

23:03.660 --> 23:06.100
Xi Luo, don't waste time.

23:06.380 --> 23:07.940
Who wants to interfere
with Her Lordship today

23:08.140 --> 23:09.060
has to die.

23:20.340 --> 23:20.940
Go after Zhu Yu.

23:21.140 --> 23:21.780
I'll handle this.

23:22.100 --> 23:22.740
Qi, go.

24:21.300 --> 24:21.700
Zhaoyan.

24:26.060 --> 24:26.660
Xian Qing.

24:44.260 --> 24:44.660
Qi.

24:51.820 --> 24:52.780
You shouldn't come.

24:55.700 --> 24:57.220
We come here with the hopes

24:57.220 --> 24:57.820
of many people.

24:59.260 --> 25:00.180
No matter what,

25:00.980 --> 25:02.060
we will try our best.

25:04.540 --> 25:06.140
In the face of ultimate power,

25:06.940 --> 25:07.580
how is hope

25:08.380 --> 25:09.980
any different from despair?

25:10.460 --> 25:11.780
As long as there's a glimmer of hope,

25:12.780 --> 25:13.860
there'll be a chance to survive.

25:15.580 --> 25:17.100
Since we all just want to survive,

25:18.100 --> 25:19.540
let's see who's got the best shot.

25:20.340 --> 25:21.180
Alright.

25:22.460 --> 25:23.500
If that's the case,

25:24.500 --> 25:25.580
then entrust your fates

25:26.180 --> 25:27.940
to your swords.

25:28.820 --> 25:29.700
What is fate?

25:30.820 --> 25:31.500
If you ask me,

25:32.220 --> 25:34.380
I am my own fate.

26:25.300 --> 26:25.780
Qi.

26:26.200 --> 26:27.510
Zhu Yu stimulated her inner strength

26:27.510 --> 26:28.820
and accelerated the transformation.

26:28.820 --> 26:29.860
This is the best chance.

26:34.420 --> 26:35.100
(Mother.)

26:36.140 --> 26:37.740
Qi, hurry up.

26:43.860 --> 26:44.420
Jinzhao.

26:46.740 --> 26:47.940
Jinzhao, how are you?

26:49.100 --> 26:50.580
I'm fine, one more.

26:52.180 --> 26:52.580
Qi.

27:44.220 --> 27:44.780
Are you okay?

27:44.820 --> 27:45.340
I am okay.

28:11.940 --> 28:13.980
No one can stop me.

28:51.060 --> 28:51.620
Zhaoyan.

29:03.660 --> 29:04.380
(The curse is gone,)

29:04.860 --> 29:05.980
(but I don't)

29:06.420 --> 29:08.300
(have much Vitality Energy left, right?)

29:34.460 --> 29:34.900
Formation.

30:28.460 --> 30:29.300
Jinzhao.

30:53.460 --> 30:53.940
Zhaoyan.

31:23.260 --> 31:25.340
Xian Qing, no!

31:26.460 --> 31:27.140
(Hanjiang.)

31:28.580 --> 31:29.540
(Without your elixir,)

31:31.180 --> 31:33.180
(I wonder what it's going
to be like when I lose)

31:34.260 --> 31:35.260
(all my energy.)

31:48.500 --> 31:49.060
(Zhaoyan.)

31:49.460 --> 31:49.980
(Move aside.)

32:56.970 --> 33:00.070
♪If I trek
through the long river of memory♪

33:00.550 --> 33:04.040
♪What will I pick up♪

33:04.040 --> 33:09.060
♪Is it joy from the past years
or piercing pain♪

33:10.740 --> 33:14.320
♪What did I hear♪

33:15.080 --> 33:18.570
♪Laughter from the Milky Way♪

33:18.570 --> 33:23.360
♪My heartbeat remembers it. Who are you♪

33:25.880 --> 33:29.080
♪I can't grasp the fleeting joy♪

33:29.570 --> 33:32.560
♪I can't have you by my side♪

33:32.560 --> 33:35.780
♪I have to come to terms
with my regrets♪

33:36.170 --> 33:39.990
♪Why do my memories stir up emotions♪

33:43.320 --> 33:46.880
♪I look for you, and I approach you♪

33:46.880 --> 33:50.600
♪Sweeping over like a tide♪

33:50.600 --> 33:54.050
♪I stole the answer
to the riddle from destiny♪

33:54.480 --> 33:57.900
♪Can it exchange for your stay♪

33:57.900 --> 34:01.460
♪I had you in my grasp, but I lost you♪

34:01.460 --> 34:04.770
♪Thus reunion took on a new meaning♪

34:08.020 --> 34:10.360
♪That's a riddle set up
in the past life♪

34:11.460 --> 34:14.139
♪Where are you who was by my side♪

34:18.570 --> 34:19.469
♪You left♪

34:19.469 --> 34:21.110
♪Even the silence speaks of pain♪

34:21.110 --> 34:23.350
♪I pass through the crowd
after you left♪

34:23.350 --> 34:24.850
♪Reach the end of time♪

34:24.850 --> 34:26.850
♪The only sentiment left there♪

34:26.850 --> 34:28.409
♪Is like your last smile♪

34:28.409 --> 34:30.070
♪Lighting up my night sky♪

34:30.070 --> 34:32.070
♪Spreading my arms, I escaped gravity♪

34:33.170 --> 34:36.489
♪It's time to let go♪

34:36.489 --> 34:39.750
♪I pretend to be able to let go♪

34:39.750 --> 34:43.120
♪The story needs some twist and turns♪

34:43.370 --> 34:46.920
♪We keep looking back
because we hate to part♪

34:46.920 --> 34:50.400
♪I look for you, and I approach you♪

34:50.400 --> 34:54.020
♪Sweeping over like a tide♪

34:54.020 --> 34:57.890
♪I stole the answer
to the riddle from destiny♪

34:57.890 --> 35:01.350
♪Can it exchange for your stay♪

35:01.670 --> 35:05.230
♪I had you in my grasp, but I lost you♪

35:05.230 --> 35:10.020
♪Thus reunion took on a new meaning♪

35:11.440 --> 35:14.960
♪That's a riddle set up
in the past life♪

35:14.960 --> 35:18.050
♪Where are you who was by my side♪

35:20.230 --> 35:23.890
♪I want to say something
but the memories are fading away♪

35:23.890 --> 35:27.560
♪My broken heart
is drowning in loneliness♪

35:27.560 --> 35:33.610
♪Will we meet again♪

35:34.820 --> 35:38.340
♪Where am I going to stop
among the crowd♪

35:38.340 --> 35:41.720
♪I know your look,
gentle and determined♪

35:41.720 --> 35:48.680
♪You will look at me and me only♪

35:52.450 --> 35:56.170
♪I met you, and I left you♪

35:56.170 --> 35:59.510
♪We pass by each other without a word♪

35:59.510 --> 36:03.420
♪My longing is embedded in every breath♪

36:03.420 --> 36:06.850
♪This is how much I love you♪

36:06.850 --> 36:11.130
♪I miss you, and I forgot about you♪

36:11.130 --> 36:15.440
♪How do I pacify
the conflicting feelings♪

36:17.810 --> 36:20.210
♪You approach me
with such determination♪

36:22.480 --> 36:26.060
♪I hear you calling my name♪
